---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Prose from "../components/Prose.astro";
const pageTitle = "George's Home";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <main>
    <Prose>
      <p>
        When I was 10yo I went to an informatics class with a friend and fell in
        love with computers. It was love at the first touch. Two years laters I
        learned my first programing language: Visual Basic <Icon
          class="inline"
          name="fa7-brands:microsoft"
          size={16}
        />. I've also figured out how to assemble and disassemble computers and
        earned a lot of money for a 12yo. The year was 2005, the beggining of my
        carreer 😂.
      </p>
      <p>
        Down the line I got a BS in Information Systems, but at some point when
        I got asked what I wanted to be when I grew up I responded:
        "Scientist!!!". Poor choice in terms of finances, good one in terms of
        passion. Down the line I got a MS in Computer Science.
      </p>
      <p>
        I am originally from Brazil 🇧🇷, but when I moved to the US 🇺🇸 in 2018,
        it was the beggining of the Deep Learning boom. Word2Vec had been
        published 5 years earlier, and everyone was working on something that
        stacked on top of it. The transformers paper had been published a year
        before I moved. I did not know TensorFlow and Hugging Face's
        transformers library did not exist yet, so I spent a few weeks writing
        my own from scratch. Pretty fun times. I am currently in Belgim 🇧🇪,
        still tinkering with computers, and still working in research.
      </p>
      <p>
        On this website, I document the things I learn and do when I have time.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Coding</strong>: <a href="https://github.com/gcgbarbosa"
            >View my GitHub</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Writing</strong>: <a href="/blog"
            >Technical articles and reflections</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Connect</strong>: <a href="mailto:gcgbarbosa@gmail.com"
            >gcgbarbosa@gmail.com</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </Prose>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
